      </ul>

      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-ink-faint">
        Primary reference: <a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7489" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-soft" rel="noopener">RFC 7489 - Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting &amp; Conformance</a>. Synthetic examples use reserved documentation domains and are for illustration only.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
